---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout
  title="Move to Canada from Africa – Free Tools & Guides | AfriMigrate"
  description="Everything you need to move to Canada from Africa: CRS calculator, Express Entry guide, PNP finder, document checklist, cost estimator — all free."
>
  <div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> / Canada</div>
  <div class="eyebrow">Canada</div>
  <h1>Move to Canada, step by step</h1>
  <p class="lead" style="margin-bottom: 2.5rem;">
    Canada is the most popular migration destination for Africans right now — and the only country where AfriMigrate's tools are fully live today. Free tools covering Express Entry, Provincial Nominee Programs, document prep, cost planning and timelines, built specifically for African applicants.
  </p>

  <div class="tools-grid">
    <div class="tool-card">
      <div class="hot">Most used</div>
      <div class="tool-icon">🧮</div>
      <h3>CRS Score Calculator</h3>
      <p>Know your Comprehensive Ranking System score in under 3 minutes and see if you're competitive for an invitation.</p>
      <a href="/canada/crs-calculator" class="tool-link">Calculate now →</a>
    </div>
    <div class="tool-card">
      <div class="tool-icon">📘</div>
      <h3>Express Entry Guide</h3>
      <p>How the Federal Skilled Worker, Canadian Experience Class and Federal Skilled Trades programs actually work.</p>
      <a href="/canada/express-entry" class="tool-link">Read the guide →</a>
    </div>
    <div class="tool-card">
      <div class="tool-icon">🗺️</div>
      <h3>Provincial Nominee Program Finder</h3>
      <p>Find which of Canada's 11 PNP streams fit your profile, including Saskatchewan's popular SINP.</p>
      <a href="/canada/pnp" class="tool-link">Find my province →</a>
    </div>
    <div class="tool-card">
      <div class="tool-icon">📋</div>
      <h3>Document Checklist</h3>
      <p>A step-by-step checklist of every document you'll need for a Canadian PR application.</p>
      <a href="/canada/document-checklist" class="tool-link">Build my checklist →</a>
    </div>
    <div class="tool-card">
      <div class="tool-icon">💰</div>
      <h3>Cost of Moving to Canada</h3>
      <p>A realistic breakdown of government fees, settlement funds, and moving costs from Africa.</p>
      <a href="/canada/cost-of-moving" class="tool-link">See the costs →</a>
    </div>
    <div class="tool-card">
      <div class="tool-icon">⏱️</div>
      <h3>PR Timeline Estimator</h3>
      <p>Get a realistic estimate of how long your pathway to Canadian permanent residence will take.</p>
      <a href="/canada/pr-timeline" class="tool-link">Estimate my timeline →</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="eyebrow">Why Canada</div>
    <h2>Canada's pull for African applicants</h2>
    <p class="lead">
      Canada runs one of the world's most transparent points-based immigration systems, welcomes over 1,300 nominees a year through African-friendly Provincial Nominee Programs, and offers a direct path from work permit or study permit to permanent residence. No job offer is required for most Express Entry applicants — your profile is scored on age, education, language ability and work experience alone.
    </p>
  </section>
</Layout>
